OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centre closed due to
OL,4,Anearby fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire on an industrial estate has led
OL,7,Fto the closure of a waste recycling
OL,8,Fsite in north Leeds.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fattended SBT Skip Hire on Milners Road
OL,12,Fin Yeadon at about 08:30 GMT on
OL,13,FThursday after the blaze broke out.
OL,15,FYeadon's household waste recycling
OL,16,Fcentre, which is further along the
OL,17,Froad, has closed as a result of the
OL,18,Ffire, according to a Facebook post by
OL,19,FGuiseley and Rawdon's three Labour
OL,20,Fcouncillors.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
