OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centre closed due to
OL,4,Anearby fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the fire service
OL,7,Fsaid nearby residents should keep
OL,8,Fwindows and doors closed and warned
OL,9,Fdrivers to avoid the area due to
OL,10,Fpossible traffic disruption.
